meta {
  name: Get Profile
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  ## Get Profile — Get authenticated user's full profile

  Protected route. Returns the authenticated user's full profile (password excluded)
  with the department relation expanded.

  ### Headers
  | Header        | Value               | Required |
  |---------------|---------------------|----------|
  | Authorization | Bearer {{authToken}}| ✅       |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "Abir Hasan",
      "username": "hasan-452187",
      "email": "abir@example.com",
      "phone": null,
      "bio": null,
      "avatar": null,
      "cover": null,
      "role": "USER",
      "student_id": "2023-123-456",
      "department": { ... },
      "skills": [],
      "website": null,
      "portfolio": null,
      "socials": null,
      "created_at": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **401** — Missing/invalid token
  - **404** — Profile not found
}
